Breachers Gets A New Map &amp; Expands Custom Game Settings	breachers-gets-a-new-map-amp-expands-custom-game-settings	Breachers gives players a new map and more custom game settings in its latest update, available now.\nUntil recently, the custom game settings were quite limited. The Custom Game Settings update lets the lobby leader specify the map, which weapons are available, and settings like movement speed, proximity chat, round times, and dual wielding. Once a fun makeshift game mode is created, it can be saved as a preset.\nDeveloper Triangle Factory has added four presets as examples of what can be built. As shown in this video from the team, things can get pretty chaotic.\nThe new update also adds a new map, Headquarters, which is the entrance floor of the ESTF (Enyo Special Task Force) headquarters you see in the game's main menu. This map is available in custom lobbies and all game modes except Bomb Defusal.\nBreachers is available now on Meta Quest, Steam, PlayStation VR2, and Pico.	[UploadVR] Breachers Gets A New Map &amp; Expands Custom Game Settings Breachers gives players a new map and more custom game settings in its latest update, available now. Until recently, the custom game settings were quite limited.	PUBLISHED	2026-08-13 20:56:31.945961+05:30	\N	\N	116	303	2026-08-13 20:56:41.751339+05:30	2026-08-14 11:19:13.136612+05:30	\N	1	https://www.uploadvr.com/breachers-headquarters-map-expanded-custom-game-settings/	UploadVR	[UploadVR] Breachers Gets A New Map &amp; Expands Custom Game Settings Breachers gives players a new map and more custom game settings in its latest update, available now. Until recently, the custom game settings were quite limited.	### Event Overview\n[UploadVR] Breachers Gets A New Map &amp; Expands Custom Game Settings Breachers gives players a new map and more custom game settings in its latest update, available now Until recently, the custom game settings were quite limited The Custom Game Settings update lets the lobby leader 