High On Life VR Announced For PC VR, PlayStation VR2 &amp; Meta Quest	high-on-life-vr-announced-for-pc-vr-playstation-vr2-amp-meta-quest	Flat2VR Studios and Squanch Games have announced a port of High On Life is coming to PC VR, PSVR2, and Meta Quest in 2027.\nA surprise trailer during today's VR Games Showcase revealed that Flat2VR Studios and Squanch Games are bringing High On Life VR to headsets in 2027.\nThe trailer offers an in-depth look at what to expect from High On Life VR, including some behind-the-scenes moments with the game's developers, who explain the major overhauls that bringing some of the game's systems to VR has demanded. These include overhauls to the shop interactions, character beats around the city, as well as physical reload mechanics for the game's highly unique weaponry.\nCheck out the full trailer below.\nOriginally released in 2022, High On Life is an irreverent take on the FPS genre in which you join forces with a roster of hilarious talking guns to blast your way through a galaxy of alien invaders.\nHigh On Life currently holds a Very Positive rating on Steam based on over 14,000 user reviews.\nHigh On Life VR is expected to arrive in 2027. You can wishlist the game now for Meta Quest, PlayStation VR2, and on PC via SteamVR.	[UploadVR] High On Life VR Announced For PC VR, PlayStation VR2 &amp; Meta Quest Flat2VR Studios and Squanch Games have announced a port of High On Life is coming to PC VR, PSVR2, and Meta Quest in 2027. A surprise trailer during today's VR Games Showcase revealed that Flat2VR Studios and Squanch...	PUBLISHED	2026-08-14 01:26:30.738837+05:30	\N	\N	116	333	2026-08-14 01:26:41.399531+05:30	2026-08-14 11:19:13.162619+05:30	\N	1	https://www.uploadvr.com/high-on-life-vr-announced-for-pc-vr-playstation-vr2-meta-quest/	UploadVR	[UploadVR] High On Life VR Announced For PC VR, PlayStation VR2 &amp; Meta Quest Flat2VR Studios and Squanch Games have announced a port of High On Life is coming to PC VR, PSVR2, and Meta Quest in