Stuffed: Two Foot Hero Is A New VR Wave Shooter Coming To SteamVR &amp; Meta Quest	stuffed-two-foot-hero-is-a-new-vr-wave-shooter-coming-to-steamvr-amp-meta-quest	Waving Bear Studio has announced Stuffed: Two Foot Hero, a new VR wave shooter coming to SteamVR and Meta Quest this fall.\nStuffed: Two Foot Hero is a sequel to Waving Bear Studio's Stuffed, which launched on Steam in 2024 and Xbox in 2023, and which currently enjoys a Mostly Positive rating based on over 225 user reviews.\nStuffed: Two Foot Hero is set inside the dreams of a little girl. The family-friendly shooter puts players in the paws of a two-foot-tall teddy bear defending its owner from waves of nightmares. Players can fight solo or team up with up to four friends. The game was built from the ground up for VR, and expands on the original Stuffed with twelve weapons, six maps, new enemies, bosses, traps, turrets, and more.\nA trailer was released as part of today's VR Games Showcase, which is included here:\nSpeaking about how the idea for Stuffed: Two Foot Hero came about, Lead Artist, Lucy Earp said, “Fans of the original Stuffed kept asking for VR, [...] so we rebuilt it from the ground up allowing players to experience the world from a two-foot-tall teddy bear and get hands on with the awesome weapons. There were so many ideas we wanted to put in the original that never made it in, and its been really exciting to explore that in this new title, we're very grateful for the opportunity – we can’t wait for players to experience it.”\nStuffed: Two Foot Hero is coming to Meta Quest and SteamVR in Fall 2026. You can wishlist the game now.	[UploadVR] Stuffed: Two Foot Hero Is A New VR Wave Shooter Coming To SteamVR &amp; Meta Quest Waving Bear Studio has announced Stuffed: Two Foot Hero, a new VR wave shooter coming to SteamVR and Meta Quest this fall. Stuffed: Two Foot Hero is a sequel to Waving Bear Studio's Stuffed, which launch...	PUBLISHED	2026-08-13 19:56:32.293963+05:30	\N	\N	117	296	2026-08-13