tps://images.unsplash.com/photo-1546776310-eef45dd6d63c?auto=format&fit=crop&w=1200&q=80	\N	2026-08-14 00:56:41.695631+05:30	2026-08-14 00:56:41.695634+05:30	994e129d8d14bdc101e2350e73463afeab9474964ab672af594cff0d9f3c585c	\N	processed	1	single_source	[The Robot Report] BioflexBot robot hand aims to replicate key human hand motions Human hands are dexterous, versatile machines. Roboticists have tried to copy the biological structures of the hand for humanoid grippers.	[{"heading": "Event Overview", "paragraphs": ["[The Robot Report] BioflexBot robot hand aims to replicate key human hand motions Human hands are dexterous, versatile machines Roboticists have tried to copy the biological structures of the hand for humanoid grippers This, however, typically results in complex and difficult-to-control structures."]}, {"heading": "Context & Technical Summary", "paragraphs": ["Researchers proposed an alternative end-effector solution in a new study published by Wiley in Advanced Science They created the BioflexBot, a novel robot that mimics and even exceeds core motions of the hand with a simple design Instead of creating a robotic hand with the intricate anatomy of a human hand, the researchers aimed to capture fundamental hand motions with a coiled spring, constraining shell, and basic pneumatic system, using compressed air to control mechanical action."]}]	full	f	\N
Payday: Aces High Holding PC VR &amp; Meta Quest 3 Playtests Next Week	payday-aces-high-holding-pc-vr-amp-meta-quest-3-playtests-next-week	Fast Travel Games is holding playtests next week for its highly anticipated co-op heist shooter Payday: Aces High on SteamVR and Quest 3.\nThe announcement came at today's VR Games Showcase with a new gameplay trailer. Playtests start on August 20.\nHere's the new trailer:\nIn Aces High, you and up to three friends take on the roles of The Aces, a group of highly skilled thieves framed by business titan Warren Jupiter. The Aces decide to seek revenge by looting locations tied to his business: banks, museums, and even his personal penthouse. Heists are always attempted in groups of four, with AI companions filling in any gaps on the team.\nThe game is slated to release later in 2026 and developer Fast Travel Games (Vampire: The Masquerade - Justice, Apex Construct) has already committed to a new post-release heist location as a free update before the end of the year.\nPayday: Aces High can be wishlisted for Steam and Quest 3 headsets.	[UploadVR] Payday: Aces High Holding PC VR &amp; Meta Quest 3 Playtests Next Week Fast Travel Games is holding playtests next week for its highly anticipated co-op heist shooter Payday: Aces High on SteamVR and Quest 3. The announcement came at today's VR Games Showcase with a new gameplay trailer.	PUBLISHED	2026-08-14 00:56:31.250765+05:30	\N	\N	117	324	2026-08-14 00:56:42.596885+05:30	2026-08-14 11:19:13.155139+05:30	\N	1	https://www.uploadvr.com/payday-aces-high-holding-pc-vr-meta-quest-3-playtests-next-week/	UploadVR	[UploadVR] Payday: Aces High Holding PC VR &amp; Meta Quest 3 Playtests Next Week Fast Travel Games is holding playtests next week for its highly anticipated co-op heist shooter Payday: Aces High on SteamVR and Quest 3. The announcement came at today's VR Games Showcase with a new gameplay trailer.	### Event Overview\n[UploadVR] Payday: Aces High Holding PC VR &amp; Meta Quest 3 Play