Multiplayer JRPG Knights Of Fiona Launches In September For PC VR &amp; Meta Quest	multiplayer-jrpg-knights-of-fiona-launches-in-september-for-pc-vr-amp-meta-quest	Knights of Fiona brings co-op JRPG-like adventure to SteamVR and Meta Quest on September 3.\nThe release date was confirmed at today's VR Games Showcase alongside a new trailer showcasing never-before-seen gameplay footage:\nWe went hands on with an early build of the game, saying "you can feel the love for this game, this world, and what it means to the team behind it in all the subtle details in the town and world, the care and refinement in card art for weapons and abilities and in the art in the town, and how much it means."\nAnother round of playtests kicks off today and runs through August 16. Character Bank launched a successful Kickstarter campaign earlier this year, raising over 3.6M yen against a 1.5M yen goal, roughly $22,600 versus $9,400.\nKnights of Fiona can be wishlisted now on the Meta Horizon Store and Steam.	[UploadVR] Multiplayer JRPG Knights Of Fiona Launches In September For PC VR &amp; Meta Quest Knights of Fiona brings co-op JRPG-like adventure to SteamVR and Meta Quest on September 3. The release date was confirmed at today's VR Games Showcase alongside a new trailer showcasing never-before-see...	PUBLISHED	2026-08-14 00:56:31.250779+05:30	\N	\N	116	325	2026-08-14 00:56:42.886483+05:30	2026-08-14 11:19:13.156021+05:30	\N	1	https://www.uploadvr.com/multiplayer-jrpg-knights-of-fiona-launches-in-september-for-pc-vr-meta-quest/	UploadVR	[UploadVR] Multiplayer JRPG Knights Of Fiona Launches In September For PC VR &amp; Meta Quest Knights of Fiona brings co-op JRPG-like adventure to SteamVR and Meta Quest on September 3. The release date was confirmed at today's VR Games Showcase alongside a new trailer showcasing never-before-see...	### Event Overview\n[UploadVR] Multiplayer JRPG Knights Of Fiona Launches In September For PC VR &amp; Meta Quest Knights of Fiona brings co-op JRPG-like a