Grablings: Paint &#x27;N Seek Is A Chaotic Social VR Game From Triangle Factory’s New Triangle Labs Label	grablings-paint-x27n-seek-is-a-chaotic-social-vr-game-from-triangle-factorys-new-triangle-labs-label	Triangle Factory and Triangle Labs have announced Grablings, a social hide and seek game coming to Meta Quest this summer.\nAs part of today's VR Games Showcase, Triangle Factory and Triangle Labs have announced a new social hide-and-seek game called Grablings: Paint 'N Seek.\nIn Grablings: Paint 'N Seek, you play as the titular Grablings, creatures which the game's developers describe as "interdimensional creatures who live for mischief and chaos."\nEssentially, you'll play silly games of hide and seek. Hiders paint themselves into wacky environments to avoid being found while the seekers aim to win by finding all the hidden Grablings.\nA new trailer has been revealed which shows a sneak peek at Grablings' chaotic social gameplay.\nThe game comes from Triangle Labs, Triangle Factory's new label. The parent company is best known for its VR FPS Forefront and Breachers. The studio has also recently announced Breachers: Outbreak, a zombie-themed extraction shooter.\nGrablings: Paint 'N Seek is coming to Meta Quest sometime this summer.	[UploadVR] Grablings: Paint &#x27;N Seek Is A Chaotic Social VR Game From Triangle Factory’s New Triangle Labs Label Triangle Factory and Triangle Labs have announced Grablings, a social hide and seek game coming to Meta Quest this summer. As part of today's VR Games Showcase, Triangle Factory an...	PUBLISHED	2026-08-14 00:56:31.250804+05:30	\N	\N	111	327	2026-08-14 00:56:43.46932+05:30	2026-08-14 11:19:13.157392+05:30	\N	1	https://www.uploadvr.com/grablings-paint-n-seek-is-a-chaotic-social-vr-game-from-triangle-factorys-new-triangle-labs-label/	UploadVR	[UploadVR] Grablings: Paint &#x27;N Seek Is A Chaotic Social VR Game From Triangle Factory’s New Triangle Labs Label Triangle Factory and Triangle Labs have announced Grablings, a soc