The Studio Behind Human Fall Flat Announces New VR Puzzle Game Tiny Flock	the-studio-behind-human-fall-flat-announces-new-vr-puzzle-game-tiny-flock	No Brakes Games, the maker of Human Fall Flat, has announced Tiny Flock, a made-for-VR physics-based puzzle game coming to Steam and Meta Quest.\nIn Tiny Flock, you'll shepherd a group of adorable sheep through 21 gorgeous 3D diorama levels with fully interactive environments and puzzles. Using physics, creativity, and objects in the game space, you'll find your own way of leading your tiny flock safely through each level.\nYou'll create paths and bridges, stack and throw objects, pull ropes and levers to create safe passage for your adorable sheep. As in the best puzzle games, there are no pre-determined solutions. Instead, the game encourages the use of physics, creativity, and the environment around you to save your wayward sheep.\nA trailer has been released alongside the announcement: \nA release date has not yet been announced, but the official website for the game has a 2026 release window, so expect it by the end of the year. Tiny Flock is eventually coming to Steam and Meta Quest.	[UploadVR] The Studio Behind Human Fall Flat Announces New VR Puzzle Game Tiny Flock No Brakes Games, the maker of Human Fall Flat, has announced Tiny Flock, a made-for-VR physics-based puzzle game coming to Steam and Meta Quest. In Tiny Flock, you'll shepherd a group of adorable sheep through 21...	PUBLISHED	2026-08-14 00:56:31.250832+05:30	\N	\N	117	330	2026-08-14 00:56:44.322591+05:30	2026-08-14 11:19:13.159875+05:30	\N	1	https://www.uploadvr.com/the-studio-behind-human-fall-flat-announces-new-vr-puzzle-game-tiny-flock/	UploadVR	[UploadVR] The Studio Behind Human Fall Flat Announces New VR Puzzle Game Tiny Flock No Brakes Games, the maker of Human Fall Flat, has announced Tiny Flock, a made-for-VR physics-based puzzle game coming to Steam and Meta Quest. In Tiny Flock, you'll shepherd a group of adorable sheep through 21...	### Even