Total Chaos VR Is Coming Soon To SteamVR &amp; Meta Quest	total-chaos-vr-is-coming-soon-to-steamvr-amp-meta-quest	Total Chaos VR is coming soon to SteamVR, and will be free for those who already own Total Chaos on Steam.\nLeading today's VR Games Showcase, developer Trigger Happy Interactive and publisher Apogee Entertainment have announced that Total Chaos VR is coming to SteamVR soon. A standalone version of the game is also coming to Meta Quest.\nTotal Chaos VR was revealed via a terrifying new trailer, which we've included here:\nThe flat screen version of Total Chaos, which debuted in 2025, is one of the creepiest and most effective psychological horror games of the last few years. It currently enjoys a Very Positive rating on Steam, collated from over 1,500 user reviews.\nIn Total Chaos, you play as a Coast Guard officer responding to a distress call from an ominous island. When a storm wrecks your boat upon the shore, you discover the island's dark past isn't totally forgotten. Compelled to explore the island by cryptic radio transmissions, you must delve ever deeper into this twisted and uncertain reality.\nThe standalone version of Total Chaos VR is in development as well, and will release on Meta's Horizon Store at a later date.	[UploadVR] Total Chaos VR Is Coming Soon To SteamVR &amp; Meta Quest Total Chaos VR is coming soon to SteamVR, and will be free for those who already own Total Chaos on Steam. Leading today's VR Games Showcase, developer Trigger Happy Interactive and publisher Apogee Entertainment have announced ...	PUBLISHED	2026-08-14 01:26:30.738813+05:30	\N	\N	116	331	2026-08-14 01:26:40.810602+05:30	2026-08-14 11:19:13.160522+05:30	\N	1	https://www.uploadvr.com/total-chaos-vr-is-coming-soon-to-steamvr-meta-quest/	UploadVR	[UploadVR] Total Chaos VR Is Coming Soon To SteamVR &amp; Meta Quest Total Chaos VR is coming soon to SteamVR, and will be free for those who already own Total Chaos on Steam. Leading today's VR Games Showcase, developer Trig