System Shock VR Announced For Meta Quest, PlayStation VR2, and PC VR	system-shock-vr-announced-for-meta-quest-playstation-vr2-and-pc-vr	Flat2VR Studios announced an official VR port of acclaimed sci-fi shooter System Shock for Meta Quest, PlayStation VR2, and SteamVR.\nThe shocking reveal was the final announcement at today's VR Games Showcase. Here's the trailer:\nFlat2VR is partnering with original developer Nightdive Studios for this port. System Shock was a hit with players when it released in 2023 after multiple delays and a seven-year development cycle. It has steadily received updates since release, with the most recent being in March of this year.\nSystem Shock was just one of several announcements from Flat2VR in the showcase. The company also announced a port of comedic first person shooter High on Life, plans to bring a 'vault' of new games to PlayStation VR2 including Drop Dead: The Cabin, and a new funding initiative to build bigger and better games.\nSystem Shock VR can be wishlisted now on Steam, PS VR2, and Quest.	[UploadVR] System Shock VR Announced For Meta Quest, PlayStation VR2, and PC VR Flat2VR Studios announced an official VR port of acclaimed sci-fi shooter System Shock for Meta Quest, PlayStation VR2, and SteamVR. The shocking reveal was the final announcement at today's VR Games Showcase.	PUBLISHED	2026-08-14 01:26:30.738828+05:30	\N	\N	117	332	2026-08-14 01:26:41.114159+05:30	2026-08-14 11:19:13.161425+05:30	\N	1	https://www.uploadvr.com/system-shock-vr-announced-for-meta-quest-playstation-vr2-and-pc-vr/	UploadVR	[UploadVR] System Shock VR Announced For Meta Quest, PlayStation VR2, and PC VR Flat2VR Studios announced an official VR port of acclaimed sci-fi shooter System Shock for Meta Quest, PlayStation VR2, and SteamVR. The shocking reveal was the final announcement at today's VR Games Showcase.	### Event Overview\n[UploadVR] System Shock VR Announced For Meta Quest, PlayStation VR2, and PC VR Flat2VR Studios announced an official VR por