XR Replay Lets You Record The Last Few Minutes Of Your Quest Gameplay	xr-replay-lets-you-record-the-last-few-minutes-of-your-quest-gameplay	XR Replay, the latest app from the developer of the popular Quest Games Optimizer, auto-records the last few minutes of gameplay so you can save it at any time.\nImagine you are playing a Quest game and something amazing happens. A great jump scare in a horror game. A highlight reel-worthy kill in a competitive shooter. However, because you were not actively recording, that moment is lost forever.\nXR Replay is designed to change that. The new app from Quest Games Optimizer developer Anagan79 runs in the background while playing a game and a simple 'save' option adds the last user-defined period of gameplay to storage.\nYou can choose to have the app track between thirty seconds and ten minutes of gameplay with different settings for aspect ratio, resolution, and bitrate. There are toggles for capturing game and microphone audio along with an option to start the application when the headset is booted.\nThere is no word from early reviews about any impact on game performance when the app is running. I am currently testing XR Replay and will write up my impressions next week.\nXR Replay is available now for $3.99.	[UploadVR] XR Replay Lets You Record The Last Few Minutes Of Your Quest Gameplay: XR Replay, the latest app from the developer of the popular Quest Games Optimizer, auto-records the last few minutes of gameplay so you can save it at any ...	PUBLISHED	2026-08-13 09:54:12.384863+05:30	\N	\N	116	235	2026-08-13 09:54:17.263503+05:30	2026-08-14 11:19:13.248893+05:30	\N	1	https://www.uploadvr.com/xr-replay-lets-you-record-the-last-few-minutes-of-your-quest-gameplay/	UploadVR	[UploadVR] XR Replay Lets You Record The Last Few Minutes Of Your Quest Gameplay XR Replay, the latest app from the developer of the popular Quest Games Optimizer, auto-records the last few minutes of gameplay so you can save it at any time. Imagine you are playing a Quest game and something amaz...	### Event Overview\n[UploadVR] XR Replay Lets You Record The Last Few Minutes Of Your Quest Gameplay XR Replay, the latest app from the developer of the popular Quest Games Optimizer, auto-records the last few minutes of gameplay so you can save it at any time Imagine you are playing a Quest game and something amazing happens A great jump scare in a horror game.\n\n### Context & Technical Summary\nA highlight reel-worthy kill in a competitive shooter However, because you were not actively recording, that moment is lost forever XR Replay is designed to change that.	["• Imagine you are playing a Quest game and something amazing happens", "• A great jump scare in a horror game", "• A highlight reel-worthy kill in a competitive shooter", "• However, because you were not actively recording, that moment is lost forever", "• XR Replay is designed to change that"]	Detailed technical breakdown across 2 dynamic sections.	Advances in AR VR XR directly impact system engineering workflows. Tracking xr hardware updates enables engineers to optimize architectural decisions and mitigate operational risks.	For SIET engineering students: Reviewing this case study offers practical grounding in XR Hardware concepts, real-world deployment patterns, and industry best practices.	ar-vr-xr	XR Hardware	["Quest"]	24	https://www.uploadvr.com/xr-replay-lets-you-record-the-last-few-minutes-of-your-quest-gameplay/	UploadVR	https://storage.ghost.io/c/2a/2f/2a2f38f0-4b71-407a-9c7e-18a9e2541980/content/images/2026/08/491824307_1766728504326391_4391567809950525707_n.webp	\N	2026-08-13 09:54:17.263257+05:30	2026-08-13 09:54:17.263259+05:30	2798d3cddcd758875b6ed7bb8a26dd7dc366874bbf9864fdc1f526c6ff23729f	\N	processed	1	single_source	[UploadVR] XR Replay Lets You Record The Last Few Minutes Of Your Quest Gameplay XR Replay, the latest app from the developer of the popular Quest Games Optimizer, auto-records the last few minutes of gameplay so you can save it 