VR Games You Can Playtest To Help Bring To Market	vr-games-you-can-playtest-to-help-bring-to-market	Are you interested in helping to shape future VR games? Read on for our list of titles currently conducting testing, and instructions for how you can join in.\nUploadVR often learns about limited-time beta testing for VR games and as a resource to the community, we're compiling them all in this article and will update it when new testing is scheduled.\nBe sure to bookmark this page as it will be regularly updated. If you are a developer conducting testing for your game or a player aware of sessions, feel free to contact us at tips@uploadvr.com with details.\nKnights of Fiona\nKnights of Fiona is a co-op JRPG from Character Bank, the team behind RuinsMagus. It is conducting open beta sessions through August 16 on SteamVR and Meta Quest with times to accommodate most regions. Steam players can join by clicking the 'Join the playtest' button on the Steam listing. Quest players can join the beta channel here. The sessions will support crossplay.\n- Session 1 - August 13 4pm - 7pm\n- Session 2 - August 14 4am - 7am\n- Session 3 - August 15 4am - August 16 10am\nDarts VR2: Bullseye\nCompetitive darts simulator Darts VR2: Bullseye is gearing up for league play with its next round of public league testing. The League mode launches in Q3 2026. This round of tests will support Meta Quest, PlayStation VR2, and SteamVR with crossplay enabled in four and eight-player tournaments. Anyone interested can join the game's Discord here. The Discord will have a voice channel available for players to chat with the development team between matches.\n- Session 1 - August 18 2pm to 5pm\n- Session 2 - August 21 2pm to 5pm\nThe Great Flood\nThe Great Flood is a mixed reality real-time strategy (RTS) game coming to Meta Quest in Q4 2026. It kicked off a two week test for multiplayer gameplay on August 4. Players can sign up via a Google form here.\nThe testing ends on August 18.\nWe will update and occasionally republish this article as new sessions pop up. If you have news of upcoming beta testing, contact us at tips@uploadvr.com.	Are you interested in helping to shape future VR games	PUBLISHED	2026-08-13 09:35:21.765363+05:30	\N	\N	117	175	2026-08-13 09:35:21.769625+05:30	2026-08-14 11:19:13.284808+05:30	\N	1	https://www.uploadvr.com/vr-games-you-can-playtest-to-help-bring-to-market/	UploadVR	[UploadVR] VR Games You Can Playtest To Help Bring To Market Are you interested in helping to shape future VR games. Read on for our list of titles currently conducting testing, and instructions for how you can join in.	### Event Overview\n[UploadVR] VR Games You Can Playtest To Help Bring To Market Are you interested in helping to shape future VR games Read on for our list of titles currently conducting testing, and instructions for how you can join in UploadVR often learns about limited-time beta testing for VR games and as a resource to the community, we're compiling them all in this article and will update it when new testing is scheduled.\n\n### Context & Technical Summary\nBe sure to bookmark this page as it will be regularly updated If you are a developer conducting testing for your game or a player aware of sessions, feel free to contact us at tips@uploadvr Knights of Fiona Knights of Fiona is a co-op JRPG from Character Bank, the team behind RuinsMagus.	["• Read on for our list of titles currently conducting testing, and instructions for how you can join in", "• UploadVR often learns about limited-time beta testing for VR games and as a resource to the community, we're compiling them all in this article and will update it when new testing is scheduled", "• Be sure to bookmark this page as it will be regularly updated", "• If you are a developer conducting testing for your game or a player aware of sessions, feel free to contact us at tips@uploadvr", "• Knights of Fiona Knights of Fiona is a co-op JRPG from Character Bank, the team behind RuinsMagus"]	Detai